  Placement: 2
  CardStory: "The debriefs are turning to interrogations. 2Spade knows it will all
    get worse, before it gets better. It\u2019s always like this. The Order is pragmatic
    before all else. Or at least it used to be. Now paranoia is rampant, accusations
    among soldiers are turning the once tight hierarchy of the Order into a witch
    hunt.\r\n\r\n2Spade thinks about his own meeting with Sergeant 6Spade. Maybe
    her eyes were too big after all. *Her spikes are more numerous, hard to parse.
    They are opaque. So are the strings that the Club wield.*\r\n\r\nSomeone has
    been entering the barracks at night. *But of course. That\u2019s where soldiers
    go to lay still when there is no light outside.* Someone has been opening locked
    doors. *Well, how else will I pass through them?*"
